{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790369930958,"sessionID":"ses_f25a7d383ffeHuuGyCzBhLloW0","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_mvUoMEwkdvrU74i4WfM56SpX","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/main.tscn\n@@\n [node name=\"Sprite2D\" type=\"Sprite2D\" parent=\"Trap\"]\n position = Vector2(64.5, 34.5)\n-rotation = 0.7853982\n-scale = Vector2(0.11, 0.11)\n+rotation = 0.0\n+scale = Vector2(0.07473366, 0.08652595)\n texture = ExtResource(\"2_igidl\")\n+\n+[node name=\"SpawningPoints\" type=\"Node2D\" parent=\"Trap\"]\n+\n+[node name=\"SpawnTop\" type=\"Marker2D\" parent=\"Trap/SpawningPoints\"]\n+position = Vector2(78.54993, 48.12784)\n+\n+[node name=\"SpawnBot\" type=\"Marker2D\" parent=\"Trap/SpawningPoints\"]\n+z_index = 1\n+position = Vector2(49.77747, 50.55056)\n*** Add File: /workspace/.godot/verify_spawning_points.gd\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+class MarkerOverlay extends Node2D:\n+\tvar points: Array[Vector2] = []\n+\tvar colors: Array[Color] = [Color.MAGENTA, Color.CYAN]\n+\n+\tfunc _draw() -> void:\n+\t\tfor i in points.size():\n+\t\t\tvar point := points[i]\n+\t\t\tdraw_circle(point, 8.0, colors[i], false, 1.5)\n+\t\t\tdraw_line(point - Vector2(13, 0), point + Vector2(13, 0), colors[i], 1.0)\n+\t\t\tdraw_line(point - Vector2(0, 13), point + Vector2(0, 13), colors[i], 1.0)\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\tcall_deferred(\"verify\")\n+\n+func verify() -> void:\n+\troot.size = Vector2i(1200, 800)\n+\tvar scene := load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n+\troot.add_child(scene)\n+\tvar sprite: Sprite2D = scene.get_node(\"Trap/Sprite2D\")\n+\tvar holder: Node2D = scene.get_node(\"Trap/SpawningPoints\")\n+\tvar top: Marker2D = holder.get_node(\"SpawnTop\")\n+\tvar bot: Marker2D = holder.get_node(\"SpawnBot\")\n+\tassert(is_zero_approx(sprite.rotation))\n+\tassert(sprite.scale.is_equal_approx(Vector2(0.07473366, 0.08652595)))\n+\tassert(holder.get_child_count() == 2)\n+\tassert(bot.z_index == 1)\n+\tprint(\"Texture dimensions: \", sprite.texture.get_size())\n+\tfor marker in [top, bot]:\n+\t\tvar texture_point: Vector2 = sprite.to_local(marker.global_position) + sprite.texture.get_size() / 2.0\n+\t\tprint(marker.name, \" local position: \", marker.position, \"; texture pixel: \", texture_point)\n+\tvar camera := Camera2D.new()\n+\tcamera.position = scene.get_node(\"Trap\").to_global(Vector2(67, 46))\n+\tcamera.zoom = Vector2(10, 10)\n+\troot.add_child(camera)\n+\tcamera.make_current()\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tvar overlay := MarkerOverlay.new()\n+\troot.add_child(overlay)\n+\tfor marker in [top, bot]:\n+\t\tvar screen_point: Vector2 = marker.get_global_transform_with_canvas().origin\n+\t\toverlay.points.append(screen_point)\n+\t\tvar label := Label.new()\n+\t\tlabel.text = marker.name\n+\t\tlabel.position = screen_point + Vector2(16, -24)\n+\t\tlabel.add_theme_color_override(\"font_color\", Color.MAGENTA if marker == top else Color.CYAN)\n+\t\tlabel.add_theme_color_override(\"font_shadow_color\", Color.BLACK)\n+\t\tlabel.add_theme_constant_override(\"shadow_offset_x\", 1)\n+\t\tlabel.add_theme_constant_override(\"shadow_offset_y\", 1)\n+\t\toverlay.add_child(label)\n+\toverlay.queue_redraw()\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tawait RenderingServer.frame_post_draw\n+\troot.get_texture().get_image().save_png(\"res://.godot/spawning_points_verified.png\")\n+\tquit()\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/scenes/main.tscn\nA workspace/.godot/verify_spawning_points.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/scenes/main.tscn\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scenes/main.tscn\n+++ /workspace/scenes/main.tscn\n@@ -9,7 +9,16 @@\n scale = Vector2(2.0, 2.0)\n \n [node name=\"Sprite2D\" type=\"Sprite2D\" parent=\"Trap\"]\n position = Vector2(64.5, 34.5)\n-rotation = 0.7853982\n-scale = Vector2(0.11, 0.11)\n+rotation = 0.0\n+scale = Vector2(0.